---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ZoomControls from '../components/ZoomControls.astro';
---
<Base title="Home" description="Chemi-Core API sources APIs, excipients and packaging from qualified global manufacturers for pharmaceutical companies in Pakistan, with DRAP-ready documentation and tracked delivery." page="home">
  <section class="hero navy">
    <div class="lat"><svg><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#hx)"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div>
        <div class="kick fi" style="--d:0ms"><i></i>Pharmaceutical indenting house · Lahore</div>
        <h1 class="split">Raw materials that keep Pakistan’s <em><span class="rot"><span>tablet</span></span> lines</em> running.</h1>
        <p class="lead fi" style="--d:650ms">We source APIs, excipients and packaging from qualified manufacturers abroad, negotiate the terms, prepare the DRAP paperwork and track every consignment to your plant.</p>
        <div class="ctas fi" style="--d:800ms">
          <a class="btn b-white mag" href="/contact/">Request a quote <svg class="ar"><use href="#arr"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn b-line mag" href="https://wa.me/923260833256" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="mol fi" style="--d:300ms;margin:0">
        <span class="orb"></span><span class="orb b"></span>
        <canvas id="mol" data-cur="Drag" aria-label="Rotating 3D model of a molecule"></canvas>
        <span class="hint" id="hint">↔ Drag to rotate</span>
        <figcaption id="mcap"><b>Paracetamol</b><span>C₈H₉NO₂ · CAS 103-90-2</span></figcaption>
        <div class="mswitch" role="group" aria-label="Choose molecule"><button type="button" data-m="0" aria-pressed="true">Paracetamol<i></i></button><button type="button" data-m="1" aria-pressed="false">Metformin<i></i></button></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="cue" aria-hidden="true">Scroll<i></i></div>
  </section>

  <div class="mq" aria-label="Materials we source"><div class="tr" id="mq">
    <span>Paracetamol <small>103-90-2</small></span><span>Metformin HCl <small>1115-70-4</small></span><span>Amoxicillin trihydrate <small>61336-70-7</small></span><span>Microcrystalline cellulose <small>PH 102</small></span><span>Magnesium stearate <small>557-04-0</small></span><span>Alu-Alu foil</span><span>Ibuprofen <small>15687-27-1</small></span><span>Lactose monohydrate</span><span>Hard gelatin capsules</span>
  </div></div>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sh">
        <h2 data-r>Everything that goes into the batch.</h2>
        <p class="muted" data-r style="--rd:120ms">Three material families, sourced from GMP-certified manufacturers and delivered with the documents your QA team needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tiles">
        <div data-r><a class="tile" href="/products/" data-cur="View">
          <div class="top"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path pathLength="1" d="M24 6h16M27 6v18L12 50a5 5 0 0 0 4.4 8h31.2a5 5 0 0 0 4.4-8L37 24V6"/><path pathLength="1" d="M17 42h30"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="28" cy="50" r="2.5"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="37" cy="46" r="3"/></svg><span class="go"><svg class="ar" width="16" height="16"><use href="#arr"/></svg></span></div>
          <h3>Active pharmaceutical ingredients</h3><p>Analgesics, antibiotics, antidiabetics and more, in BP, USP and EP grades.</p>
          <ul><li><span>Paracetamol</span><span>103-90-2</span></li><li><span>Metformin HCl</span><span>1115-70-4</span></li><li><span>Amoxicillin trihydrate</span><span>61336-70-7</span></li></ul>
        </a></div>
        <div data-r style="--rd:120ms"><a class="tile" href="/products/" data-cur="View">
          <div class="top"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle pathLength="1" cx="22" cy="40" r="13"/><path pathLength="1" d="M12.8 30.8l18.4 18.4"/><rect pathLength="1" x="35" y="8" width="15" height="36" rx="7.5" transform="rotate(28 42.5 26)"/><path pathLength="1" d="M33.6 22.5l17.8 7"/></svg><span class="go"><svg class="ar" width="16" height="16"><use href="#arr"/></svg></span></div>
          <h3>Excipients</h3><p>Fillers, binders, disintegrants and lubricants in pharmacopoeial grades.</p>
          <ul><li><span>Microcrystalline cellulose</span><span>9004-34-6</span></li><li><span>Lactose monohydrate</span><span>64044-51-5</span></li><li><span>Magnesium stearate</span><span>557-04-0</span></li></ul>
        </a></div>
        <div data-r style="--rd:240ms"><a class="tile" href="/products/" data-cur="View">
          <div class="top"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect pathLength="1" x="7" y="14" width="50" height="36" rx="6"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="20" cy="26" r="5"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="32" cy="26" r="5"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="44" cy="26" r="5"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="20" cy="39" r="5"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="32" cy="39" r="5"/><circle pathLength="1" cx="44" cy="39" r="5"/></svg><span class="go"><svg class="ar" width="16" height="16"><use href="#arr"/></svg></span></div>
          <h3>Packaging components</h3><p>Primary packaging that protects stability and keeps your lines running.</p>
          <ul><li><span>Alu-Alu &amp; blister foil</span><span>OPA/Alu/PVC</span></li><li><span>PVC / PVDC film</span><span>40–90 gsm</span></li><li><span>Hard gelatin capsule shells</span><span>00 – 4</span></li></ul>
        </a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="sec navy routes">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div>
        <h2 data-r>From the world’s API makers to Lahore.</h2>
        <p class="muted" data-r style="--rd:100ms;font-size:.98rem;margin-top:20px;max-width:40ch">Materials move by sea through Karachi, or by air when a production line can’t wait. We coordinate every leg.</p>
        <div class="rleg" id="rleg">
          <button type="button" data-rt="r1" style="--c:#5CB8F5" data-r><i></i><div><b>Europe by sea</b><span>Via the Suez Canal to Port Qasim / Karachi</span></div></button>
          <button type="button" data-rt="r2" style="--c:#F5B85A;--rd:60ms" data-r><i></i><div><b>China by sea</b><span>Through the Strait of Malacca to Karachi</span></div></button>
          <button type="button" data-rt="r3" style="--c:#FF7B6E" data-r><i></i><div><b>Air freight</b><span>Urgent lots flown directly to Lahore</span></div></button>
          <button type="button" data-rt="r4" style="--c:#3CE0B5" data-r><i></i><div><b>Karachi to Lahore</b><span>Cleared at port, then delivered by road</span></div></button>
        </div>
        <p class="rnote">Illustrative routes. Actual origins depend on the material and manufacturer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rmap" data-r style="--rd:120ms"><div class="zwrap"><ZoomControls />
        <svg viewBox="0 30 1000 510" role="img" aria-label="Map of typical supply routes from Europe and China to Karachi and Lahore">
          <g class="gr">
            <path d="M0 10H1000M0 140H1000M0 270H1000M0 400H1000M0 530H1000M111 0V540M222 0V540M333 0V540M444 0V540M556 0V540M667 0V540M778 0V540M889 0V540"/>
          </g>
          <g class="gl"><text x="6" y="134">45°N</text><text x="6" y="264">30°N</text><text x="6" y="394">15°N</text><text x="227" y="530">30°E</text><text x="560" y="530">75°E</text><text x="893" y="530">120°E</text></g>
          <path id="r1" class="rt" pathLength="1" style="--c:#5CB8F5;--rd2:.1s" d="M74 66Q30 200 241 272Q292 340 321 421Q410 360 496 315"/>
          <path id="r2" class="rt" pathLength="1" style="--c:#F5B85A;--rd2:.4s" d="M900 260Q868 430 769 505Q650 532 593 478Q536 410 496 315"/>
          <path id="r3" class="rt" pathLength="1" style="--c:#FF7B6E;--rd2:.7s" d="M900 260Q730 110 551 257"/>
          <path id="r4" class="rt" pathLength="1" style="--c:#3CE0B5;--rd2:1.4s" d="M496 315Q540 300 551 257"/>
          <circle class="mv" data-rt="r1" r="6" style="--c:#5CB8F5"><animateMotion dur="7s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#r1"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="mv" data-rt="r2" r="6" style="--c:#F5B85A"><animateMotion dur="8s" begin="-3s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#r2"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="mv" data-rt="r3" r="5" style="--c:#FF7B6E"><animateMotion dur="3.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#r3"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="mv" data-rt="r4" r="5" style="--c:#3CE0B5"><animateMotion dur="2.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#r4"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="city" cx="74" cy="66" r="6"/><text class="cs" x="88" y="56">EUROPE</text><text class="cl" x="88" y="74">Hamburg</text>
          <circle class="city" cx="900" cy="260" r="6"/><text class="cs" x="890" y="290" text-anchor="end">CHINA</text><text class="cl" x="890" y="307" text-anchor="end">Shanghai</text>
          <circle class="city" cx="496" cy="315" r="6"/><text class="cs" x="484" y="342" text-anchor="end">PORT</text><text class="cl" x="484" y="359" text-anchor="end">Karachi</text>
          <circle class="pulse" cx="551" cy="257" r="16"/><circle class="hubc" cx="551" cy="257" r="8"/><text class="cs" x="534" y="222" text-anchor="end">31.5°N 74.3°E</text><text class="cl" x="534" y="240" text-anchor="end">Lahore · Chemi-Core</text>
        </svg>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec ice proc">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div class="left">
        <h2 data-r>How an indent moves.</h2>
        <p class="muted" data-r style="--rd:100ms;font-size:.98rem;max-width:36ch">From your specification to your warehouse, with one team accountable at every handover.</p>
        <div class="trk" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="row"><span>Your order</span><span id="tn">Stage 1 of 8</span></div>
          <div class="now" id="tt"><span>Requirement</span></div>
          <div class="route"><span class="done" id="td"></span><span class="ship" id="ts"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M1 10h14l-2 4H3zM4 10V6h5v4M9 7.5h3l1.5 2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></div>
          <div class="ends"><span>Supplier</span><span>Your plant</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps" id="steps">
        <span class="fill" id="sf"></span>
        <li data-t="Requirement"><span class="dot">1</span><h3>Requirement</h3><p>You share the material, grade, pharmacopoeia, quantity and target delivery date.</p></li>
        <li data-t="Supplier match"><span class="dot">2</span><h3>Supplier match</h3><p>We shortlist qualified manufacturers and collect comparable quotations.</p></li>
        <li data-t="Negotiation"><span class="dot">3</span><h3>Negotiation</h3><p>We secure the price, payment terms and Incoterms on your behalf.</p></li>
        <li data-t="Samples & dossier"><span class="dot">4</span><h3>Samples &amp; dossier</h3><p>CoA, MSDS, GMP certificate and DMF are reviewed before you commit.</p></li>
        <li data-t="DRAP paperwork"><span class="dot">5</span><h3>DRAP paperwork</h3><p>Import documentation is prepared to meet regulatory requirements.</p></li>
        <li data-t="In transit"><span class="dot">6</span><h3>Shipment</h3><p>Loading, transit and port clearance are tracked, with regular status updates to your team.</p></li>
        <li data-t="Delivered"><span class="dot">7</span><h3>Delivery</h3><p>Material arrives at your plant with complete batch documentation.</p></li>
        <li data-t="After-sales"><span class="dot">8</span><h3>After-sales</h3><p>We stay on for queries, deviations and repeat orders.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sh"><h2 data-r>Why procurement teams stay with us.</h2><p class="muted" data-r style="--rd:120ms">We take on the sourcing work that slows production down.</p></div>
      <div class="why">
        <div class="it" data-r><span class="ib"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg></span><div><h3>Supplier identification</h3><p class="muted">We keep qualifying new manufacturers, so you always have an alternative source for critical materials.</p></div></div>
        <div class="it" data-r style="--rd:100ms"><span class="ib"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9z"/><path d="M14 3v6h6M8 14l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><div><h3>Regulatory documentation</h3><p class="muted">Complete files aligned with DRAP and pharmacopoeial requirements, ready before the material lands.</p></div></div>
        <div class="it" data-r><span class="ib"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-3.5-7.1"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><div><h3>Round-the-clock contact</h3><p class="muted">Reach us by phone, WhatsApp, WeChat or email at any stage of an order.</p></div></div>
        <div class="it" data-r style="--rd:100ms"><span class="ib"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14v-3a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v3"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1"/></svg></span><div><h3>After-sales support</h3><p class="muted">Our responsibility continues after delivery, through quality queries and reorders.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec bigcta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 data-r>Need a material quoted this week?</h2>
      <a class="ring mag" href="/contact/" aria-label="Send an enquiry" data-r style="--rd:150ms">
        <svg class="txt" viewBox="0 0 190 190" aria-hidden="true"><text><textPath href="#cp">SEND AN ENQUIRY · SEND AN ENQUIRY · </textPath></text></svg>
        <span class="core"><svg><use href="#arr"/></svg></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<script>
  import '../scripts/molecule';
</script>
